Dataset

MetaPassAV:
Passive Behavior Tracking of Avatars

Version:
v1.0

Authors:
Ravi Prakash
School of Computer Science and Engineering
Digital University Kerala

Tony Thomas
School of Computer Science and Engineering
Digital University Kerala

Description

MetaPassAV is an anonymized behavioral authentication dataset consisting of
passive avatar kinematic observations collected in an immersive virtual
environment using a Meta Quest 2 headset. The dataset is intended for research
in behavioral authentication, user identification, and immersive computing.

Citation

If you use this dataset in your research, please cite the accompanying paper
and the dataset repository.

